  "notes": "See the Readme file: Emergency Shelters Locations Readme.xls\r\n\r\nThe data set is a point file that contains the location of the shelters within the City of Toronto, maintained by Hostel Services. This is a City-wide GIS point file that shows the locations of the shelters within the City of Toronto.\r\n\r\nThe dataset is a City-wide GIS point file and is best utilized when overlaid with City's Street Centreline file.\r\n",
